Features:
Dynamic Command-Line Args to specify model 
Model weights and biases stored in 1D array
Forward pass: implemented with recursion to go thru deeper each layer, and for loop for iterating thru each individual node in layer
Backward pass: implmented with recursion to propagate thru layers until reach very first hidden layer

Prev Changes: 
- added loss func parameter to command line and implemented loss_func() to return 3 diff loss functions, MSE, MAE

Cur Changes:
- added loss func parameter to command line and implemented loss_func() to return 3 diff loss functions, MSE, MAE, BCE, & Focal loss
- Working on implementing recursive backwards pass
    * updated forward pass to save activations in list self.model_activations (np array) to be used in backwards pass calculation
    * updated self.indices to include indices for self.model_activations
    * created new instance variable, self.model_activations_idx to track which activation we are on throughout forward pass
- Adjusted print statements of forward pass to match backwards pass
- Deleted redundant variable for creating key values of self.indices
- Fixed bug with num_layers where I wasn't counting the output layer at self.indices["num_layers"]'s initialization so output layer's
weights and biases weren't generated. Pretty easy fix, but integral to model function as previously my output layer activations weren't
being calculated!

Challenges:
- had to make sure to first create an np.zeros array that is the size for all hidden layers combined for self.model_activations in 
order to modify arrays in-place. Initially when I implemented self.model_activations, I created an empty array and planned to append
each activation layer individually to self.model_activations. HOWEVER, np arrays have immutable allocation of memory, so np.append 
returns a different array than the original one. So for the sake of memory optimization, rather than appending to it, allocated 
memory via creating np.zeros array of final array size, and created self.model_activations_idx variable to track idx when appending
to self.model_array during forward pass.


